  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「コホ、コホ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「ふぅん、バスケ部ってそんな感じの雰囲気なんだね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「けっこう厳しそう、っていうか大変そうな部活だけど。まりあちゃんには、楽しめたのかな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「バスケするまりあちゃんって、想像つかないけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「わたしも見たかったなぁ、保健室でダウンしてたのが悔やまれるよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「おかげで、ずいぶん休めたから。体調は戻ってきたよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「コホ、コホ……まだちょっと、グッタリしてるけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「まりあちゃんも、わたしと同じぐらい運動苦手のはずだから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「きっと、くたびれてるだろうなぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「ふふ、でも部活をしてると青春を満喫してる～って感じでいいよね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「わたしも、どっか良い感じの部活を探して入ってみようかな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「でもなぁ、やっぱり運動部はきついよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「龍泉寺さんには悪いけど、空手部は体験入部しただけで翌日まったく動けなくなったしね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「まりあちゃんがバスケ部に入るなら、わたしは運動部以外に入ったほうがバランスとれるだろうし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「ほら、例の『帰宅部争奪戦』的にはね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「体育会系と文化系の部活に、それぞれちょうどいい人数が入れば丸く収まる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「そのはずだけど、なかなか難しいよね。状況に流されて選ぶものでもないと思うし、部活って」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「でもまぁ。こんな機会でもないと、『部活をしよう』って発想すらなかったから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「新鮮で楽しくはあるんだけど、悩ましいよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「誰も傷つかないかたちで、ぜんぶ片付けばいいんだけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 4,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
